Package: irtident
Type: Package
Title: Practical Identification Diagnostics for Item Response Models Fitted with 'mirt'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yonggi", "Kim", email = "yonggi1124@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Assesses parameter precision and identification in unidimensional,
    single-group item response models fitted with 'mirt'. Provides item-level
    variance decomposition, profile likelihood intervals, comparisons of
    estimates from multiple starting values, and simulations of parameter
    recovery across sample sizes. Profile diagnostics follow the practical
    identifiability approach of Raue et al. (2009)
    <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btp358>. Models are estimated with 'mirt'
    (Chalmers, 2012) <doi:10.18637/jss.v048.i06>.
